#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1133 expect=noViolation domain=DM
#note "Boundary: one PBO subject leaves ACTARM empty (e.g. never treated) while the others agree on 'Placebo'. An empty description is not a competing value."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset DM label="Demographics"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col ACTARMCD type=Char label="Actual Arm Code"
col ACTARM   type=Char label="Description of Actual Arm"
---
S1 | DM | 001 | PBO | Placebo
S1 | DM | 002 | PBO |
S1 | DM | 003 | PBO | Placebo
